From 02e87144368385e2a27d893d028d30431d2adc4f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xander Burchartz <210020462+xanderburchartz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:50:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 25/32] grib_pi: iOS layout

GRIB control bar, settings and request dialogs fitted to a phone screen
(compact bar as on Android, plus the file open button that Android
replaces with its own screen). The last GRIB file is remembered across
reinstalls and app kills, and GRIB files get their own Documents/GRIB folder.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
